  "title": "Sesame Chicken Pasta Salad",
  "description": "The perfect picnic pasta salad! Chopped chicken combines with toasted sesame seeds, spinach and green onions, all marinated in a sweet and tangy soy and vinegar-based dressing.",
  "authors": [
